      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046487">Multiply scalar double precision floating-point value from xmm1 and xmm3/m64, add to xmm2 and put result in xmm1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1046452">EVEX.LLIG.66.0F38.W1 A9 /r </para>
      <para unique="1046453">VFMADD213SD xmm1 {k1}{z}, xmm2, xmm3/m64{er} </para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046457">B</para>
