     <td><para unique="1046459">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046464">AVX512F</para>
      <para unique="1046465">OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+559852"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046467">Multiply scalar double precision floating-point value from xmm1 and xmm2, add to xmm3/m64 and put result in xmm1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1046435">EVEX.LLIG.66.0F38.W1 B9 /r </para>
      <para unique="1046436">VFMADD231SD xmm1 {k1}{z}, xmm2, xmm3/m64{er}</para>
